<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n92245" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥᾱχ-ός</span></b> , ἡ (in codd.
		freq. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥάχος</span>, but the 
			Ion.
		 form <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥηχός</span></b> 
		<i><span class="en">
			Hdt.
			7.142
		</span></i>, and the compd. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὔρρηχος</span> show
		that it must be either <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥᾱχός</span> or
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥᾶχος</span>:— in <i><span class="en">
			<u>EM</u>
			703.1
		</span></i>
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥάχος, ὁ</span>):—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>thorn-hedge</i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				812
			</span></i> (pl.), <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyn.</u>
				10.7
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				1.225
			</span></i>; in <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
			</span></i> l.c., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥηχός</span> is prob.
				<i>palisade</i> or <i>wattled fence; brushwood</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥαχὸς</span> (
				Dor.
			 acc. pl.) 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καὶ φρύγανα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>GDI</u>
					5027
				</span></i>
			 (<span class="entity">Crete</span>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> generally, <i>twig, branch</i>, of the
			vine, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>CP</u>
				3.7.3
			</span></i>; of the tamarisk, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phot.
			</span></i>, dub. in <i><span class="en">
				Orph.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				31 ii 10
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> at Troezen,
				<i>wild olive tree</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Paus.
				2.32.10
			</span></i>.</div>
